---
layout: base.njk
title: YAF
css: yaf.css
description: Youth Alive Fellowship (YAF) at Winners Chapel International Ruiru. Picnics, sports, hikes, worship experiences and Fire Night for young people.
leader: Sharon Gaita
meets: to be announced
# whatsapp: the leader's number with country code, no + or spaces, e.g. 2547XXXXXXXX
whatsapp: 254740382560
---

{# ===== Hero ===== #}
<section class="yaf-hero">
  <div class="container yaf-hero__inner">
    <p class="yaf-pill">YAF</p>
    <h1 class="yaf-hero__title">Youth Alive <span class="yaf-gold">Fellowship</span></h1>
    <p class="yaf-hero__lead">Where young people meet God, make real friends and have a great time doing it.</p>
    <blockquote class="yaf-verse yaf-verse--light">
      <p>Let no man despise thy youth; but be thou an example of the believers, in word, in conversation, in charity, in spirit, in faith, in purity.</p>
      <cite>1 Timothy 4:12</cite>
    </blockquote>
    <div class="yaf-hero__actions">
      {% if whatsapp %}
        {% set joinMsg = "Hello, I would like to join Youth Alive Fellowship (YAF)." %}
        <a class="btn btn--gold" href="https://wa.me/{{ whatsapp }}?text={{ joinMsg | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join the fellowship</a>
      {% else %}
        <a class="btn btn--gold" href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">Join the fellowship</a>
      {% endif %}
      <a class="yaf-hero__link" href="#events">See what we do</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Moving ticker ===== #}
<div class="yaf-ticker" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="yaf-ticker__track">
    {% for i in [1, 2] %}
      <div class="yaf-ticker__group">
        <span>Picnics</span><span class="yaf-ticker__sep">&#10022;</span>
        <span>Sports</span><span class="yaf-ticker__sep">&#10022;</span>
        <span>Hikes</span><span class="yaf-ticker__sep">&#10022;</span>
        <span>Worship</span><span class="yaf-ticker__sep">&#10022;</span>
        <span>Fire Night</span><span class="yaf-ticker__sep">&#10022;</span>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

{# ===== What we do ===== #}
<section class="yaf-section" id="events">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="yaf-head">
      <h2 class="yaf-heading">Life in YAF</h2>
      <p>Something for every kind of young person: fun, friendship and faith, all in one place.</p>
      <blockquote class="yaf-verse yaf-verse--center">
        <p>They that wait upon the Lord shall renew their strength; they shall mount up with wings as eagles; they shall run, and not be weary; and they shall walk, and not faint.</p>
        <cite>Isaiah 40:31</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <div class="yaf-grid">
      {% for item in yaf %}
        <article class="yaf-card">
          <div class="yaf-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ item.icon }}</div>
          <h3 class="yaf-card__title">{{ item.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ item.text }}</p>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Fire Night spotlight ===== #}
<section class="yaf-fire" id="fire-night">
  <div class="container yaf-fire__inner">
    <div>
      <p class="yaf-pill yaf-pill--fire">Youth kesha</p>
      <h2 class="yaf-fire__title">Fire Night</h2>
      <p class="yaf-fire__text">Our youth kesha: a night of worship, prayer and the Word for young people who want more of God. Come ready to be stirred up.</p>
      <blockquote class="yaf-verse yaf-verse--light">
        <p>Not slothful in business; fervent in spirit; serving the Lord.</p>
        <cite>Romans 12:11</cite>
      </blockquote>
      <ul class="yaf-fire__facts">
        <li><strong>Next Fire Night:</strong> To be announced</li>
        <li><strong>Time:</strong> To be announced</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="yaf-fire__flame" aria-hidden="true">&#128293;</div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== Join ===== #}
<section class="container yaf-join" id="join">
  <div>
    <h2 class="yaf-heading">Your place is here</h2>
    <p>Youth Alive Fellowship is the youth ministry of {{ site.name }}. Whether you are new to church or have been here all your life, come and be part of the family.</p>
    <blockquote class="yaf-verse">
      <p>Iron sharpeneth iron; so a man sharpeneth the countenance of his friend.</p>
      <cite>Proverbs 27:17</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </div>

  <aside class="yaf-facts">
    <h2 class="yaf-facts__title">Quick facts</h2>
    <ul class="yaf-facts__list">
      <li><span class="yaf-facts__label">Full name:</span> Youth Alive Fellowship</li>
      <li><span class="yaf-facts__label">For:</span> Young people</li>
      <li><span class="yaf-facts__label">Meets:</span> {{ meets or "To be announced" }}</li>
      <li><span class="yaf-facts__label">Youth President:</span> {{ leader or "To be announced" }}</li>
    </ul>
    {% if whatsapp %}
      {% set msg = "Hello, I would like to know more about Youth Alive Fellowship (YAF)." %}
      <a class="btn btn--whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/{{ whatsapp }}?text={{ msg | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat with the YAF leader on WhatsApp</a>
    {% else %}
      <p class="yaf-facts__note">The leader's WhatsApp number will be added soon. In the meantime, <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">contact the church office</a>.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </aside>
</section>
